{"video":"oMLy5znlXSE","lines":[{"t":[0,1.5],"en":"Good morning."},{"t":[1.5,3.8],"en":"Whoo! Swiss Family Ronvinson."},{"t":[3.8,5.5],"en":"That hat is dope."},{"t":[5.5,6.5],"en":"Thanks, Tom."},{"t":[6.5,9.6],"en":"You mind if I rock that Bad Larry on my dome?"},{"t":[9.6,12.1],"en":"Wear it on my head? Try it on the ladies?"},{"t":[14.1,15.3],"en":"Be my guest."},{"t":[15.3,18.6],"en":"Hi. I'm Tom. I have a raccoon on my head."},{"t":[20.1,21.4],"en":"Uh, excuse me."},{"t":[21.4,23.3],"en":"My friend over here was digging through your trash,"},{"t":[23.3,24.7],"en":"and I think we may have a lot in common."},{"t":[24.7,25.7],"en":"I'm Tom."},{"t":[25.7,27.3],"en":"Would you like to see a movie sometime?"},{"t":[27.3,29.6],"en":"Are you a raccoon?"},{"t":[29.6,33.6],"en":"Because you've been running around my hat all day-- head all day?"},{"t":[33.6,36.6],"en":"Girl, you're more precious than precious."},{"t":[36.6,37.6],"en":"Uh-uh."},{"t":[39.6,42.6],"en":"Nice hat. Want a bone? That's you talking to me."},{"t":[42.6,43.6],"en":"No."},{"t":[43.6,45.6],"en":"How about..."},{"t":[45.6,47.6],"en":"Yes, I am a hunter."},{"t":[47.6,49.6],"en":"And it's you season."},{"t":[49.6,50.6],"en":"Whoa!"},{"t":[50.6,52.6],"en":"That's great! I gotta get back out there."},{"t":[52.6,54.6],"en":"You know what they say."},{"t":[54.6,56.6],"en":"Animal on the head, manimal in the bed."},{"t":[56.6,59.2],"en":"Damn, girl, your hotness killed my raccoon."},{"t":[59.2,60.2],"en":"I've got a raccoon hat."},{"t":[60.2,61.2],"en":"I'm an interesting person."},{"t":[61.2,62.2],"en":"Hello."},{"t":[65.2,66.2],"en":"Any luck?"},{"t":[66.2,67.2],"en":"No."},{"t":[67.2,68.2],"en":"Didn't work out as well as I thought it would."},{"t":[68.2,69.2],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[69.2,71.2],"en":"Better luck next time."},{"t":[71.2,72.2],"en":"I tried."},{"t":[72.2,73.2],"en":"Just didn't seem like..."},{"t":[73.2,74.2],"en":"Wow, I love that hat."},{"t":[74.2,76.2],"en":"Thank you, ma'am."},{"t":[76.2,7